. * ============================
. * Analysis
. * ============================
. 
. * Deviation from  PAP. The original analysis proved infeasible due to a lack 
> of observations.
. * Therefore I switched analysis strategies, instead of a fixed effects model 
> I perform propensity score matching and do a linear regression
. * I also change the dependent variable i.e. how gender attitudes are measured
> . Instead of plj0621 and plj0622 (the two items with the only acceptable alph
> a from plj0621:plj0625)
. * I use plh0357 and plh0359 instead, which are attitudes towards homosexualit
> y. The original items were about working women. These are arugably different 
> aspects of gender equality.
. 
